      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T13:27:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the point this helper function is called, is possible for `desc.vkFormat !\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 desc.externalFormat !\u003d 0` to be true? Can we just check the external format and have an assert that both can\u0027t be non-zero?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 229,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 229,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "0667987fdbbbd28270c313697ab001e75d3d7b39",
