      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T17:21:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "TL;DR: Removed this function but kept the `kIntsNeededKnownFormat` and `kIntsNeededExternalFormat` definitions.\n\nI see what you mean - we do need to know the number of int32s required when forming the ycbcr descriptor key within `DawnCaps`, but also from within `DawnGraphicsPipeline` in the next CL when we determine the key stride for parsing ycbcr information from numerical key representation. However, in the latter case, we are not going from a `YCbCrVkDescriptor` but from whether or not we are using an external format, so this function would end up just being used in one area. Good callout",
